---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Evidence Gallery | The Cost of Quality">
	<main class="container">
		<header>
			<h1>Evidence Gallery</h1>
			<p>A compilation of geospatial, econometric, and machine learning evidence supporting the fertility transition analysis.</p>
		</header>

		<div class="gallery">
			<article class="card">
				<div class="visual">
					<img src="/animations/fertility_decline_1851_1881.gif" alt="Fertility Time-lapse" />
				</div>
				<div class="content">
					<h2>🎬 Temporal Evolution</h2>
					<p>
						This time-lapse tracks the 'cooling' of fertility rates from 1851 to 1881. 
						Notice how high-fertility orange regions gradually darken, especially around 
						evolving industrial and policy hubs.
					</p>
				</div>
			</article>

			<article class="card">
				<div class="visual">
					<img src="/spatial/lisa_tfr_1851.png" alt="LISA Cluster map" />
				</div>
				<div class="content">
					<h2>🗺️ Spatial Auto-correlation</h2>
					<p>
						Local Indicators of Spatial Association (LISA) identify significant local clusters 
						of high-fertility (Red) and low-fertility (Blue). This diagnostics proves that 
						fertility is a geographic diffusion process.
					</p>
				</div>
			</article>

			<article class="card">
				<div class="visual">
					<img src="/ml/shap_summary_plot.png" alt="SHAP Plot" />
				</div>
				<div class="content">
					<h2>🤖 Predictive Importance (AI)</h2>
					<p>
						A SHAP-interpreted Random Forest model ranks the global predictive importance of variables. 
						Our results confirm that infant mortality and female child labor are the strongest 
						drivers of fertility variation.
					</p>
				</div>
			</article>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.container {
		max-width: 1000px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 4rem 2rem;
	}
	header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
	}
	h1 {
		font-size: 4rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}
	.gallery {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 6rem;
	}
	.card {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
		gap: 3rem;
		align-items: center;
	}
	.card:nth-child(even) {
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
	}
	.card:nth-child(even) .visual {
		order: 2;
	}
	.visual img {
		width: 100%;
		border-radius: 4px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
	}
	h2 {
		font-size: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
	.content p {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		opacity: 0.9;
	}

	@media (max-width: 800px) {
		.card, .card:nth-child(even) {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			text-align: center;
		}
		.card:nth-child(even) .visual {
			order: 0;
		}
	}
</style>
